"Land doesn't disappear. It's the safest kind of wealth.",
"You can only build and break inside land you've bought. Everything outside belongs to everyone.",
"Gregory of the Bank of Vestalia. How may I help you?",
"To make people trust each other, we first had to make them trust money.",
"New here, are you? Before you go adventuring you need to know where to keep your money. Go and say hello to the town's banker. You lose part of the money you carry when you die, so it's safer to deposit it.",
"The banker is the middle-aged clerk in town. Go and have a word.",
"So you've met the banker. That's one less worry about money. It isn't much, but here's some pocket money.",
"Next is farming. Buy wheat seeds from the Crop Merchant, plant them in a field, then harvest the grown wheat and bring it to me. Mind that only seeds bought at the shop can be planted.",
"Bring 8 wheat. The Crop Merchant has the seeds.",
"Fine wheat! Money earned by your own sweat is worth the most.",
"Monsters come out at night. Take a weapon, defeat 5 monsters and come back. Don't push yourself. There's no shame in running when it's dangerous.",
"Defeat 5 monsters. Any kind will do.",
"You made it back safe. You're a proper adventurer now.",
"Last of all, shouldn't you have land of your own? Find the Land Merchant and ask about land deeds. Then come back and tell me which road you want to walk.",
"Go and speak to the Land Merchant.",
"Having land steadies the heart. Now then, which road do you want to walk?",
"Interested in the Swordsman, who fights mainly with the sword? Go and find Leon the Sword Instructor in town. He's strict, but his skill is beyond doubt.",
