"Talk to Garen the Shield Keeper.",
"So you've met Garen the Shield Keeper. Now take the test they set you.",
"If the Archer, who pierces enemies from afar, interests you, go and find Lia the Hunter. A young woman who smells of the forest.",
"Talk to Lia the Hunter.",
"So you've met Lia the Hunter. Now take the test they set you.",
"Bring 16 feathers and 8 flint.",
"Defeat 8 skeletons.",
"Defeat 8 spiders and bring 8 string.",
"Defeat 6 creepers.",
"Bring 1 crossbow and defeat 10 skeletons.\n[archers] I'll give you an archer's hood, too. Make the rest of the archer's outfit with 3 leather and 2 chains and try it on.",
"Are you drawn to the path of magic? Go and find Elise the Archmage. She is fond of books and stars.",
"Talk to Elise the Archmage.",
"So you've met Elise the Archmage. Now take the test they set you.",
"Bring 16 lapis lazuli and 3 books.\n[irons_spellbooks] A scroll, used from the hand, casts its spell once without mana and then vanishes, dear. Save it and inscribe it into a spell book, and you can use it again and again.",
"Bring 12 amethyst shards and 12 glowstone dust.",
"Bring 32 redstone dust.\n[irons_spellbooks] When you finish I will give you the simplest spell book. Put it in the spell book slot of your accessories, choose a spell with the {key:key.irons_spellbooks.spell_wheel} key, then cast with the {key:key.irons_spellbooks.spellbook_cast} key.",
"Defeat 4 creepers and bring 8 gunpowder.\n[irons_spellbooks] An inscription table is made from 1 book, 3 wooden slabs and 2 wooden fences, dear. Place a spell book and a scroll on it to inscribe the scroll's spell into the book.",
"An enderman is a mass of mana that passes between dimensions. Bring down 3 endermen and bring 4 ender pearls. Take care not to meet their eyes.\n[wizards] You can make a novice wand from 1 coal and 1 stick, dear. Make a spell book at the spell binding table and fill it with spells, then hold a wand or staff to use them.",
"Defeat 3 endermen and bring 4 ender pearls.\n[wizards] You can make a novice wand from 1 coal and 1 stick, dear. Make a spell book at the spell binding table and fill it with spells, then hold a wand or staff to use them.",
