"Bring 8 steaks and 8 cooked porkchops.\n[kaleidoscope_cookery] Make a stove from 8 cobblestone and a campfire, and a frying pan from 7 iron ingots, and set the pan on the stove. The stove is lit with flint and steel.\n[kaleidoscope_cookery] Oil the pan, put in the ingredients, stir them a few times with a spatula (iron ingot, iron nugget, stick) and serve into a bowl, and you have a dish. Oil comes from butchering a pig with a kitchen cleaver, so when you finish I'll give you a cleaver.",
